age\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%A1%E5%8D%A1%E5%B0%BC%E4%BA%9A\" title=\"卡卡尼亚\"><img alt=\"卡卡尼亚\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%A1%E5%8D%A1%E5%B0%BC%E4%BA%9A\" title=\"卡卡尼亚\">卡卡尼亚</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span></div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>多焦点舞台</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：308005</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">1技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">2技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3080/308005/卡卡尼亚skill1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3080/308005/卡卡尼亚born.mp4_20260811_162357.167.png\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3080/308005/卡卡尼亚skill2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3080/308005/卡卡尼亚born.mp4_20260811_162357.167.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3080/308005/卡卡尼亚unique.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3080/308005/卡卡尼亚born.mp4_20260811_162357.167.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3080/308005/卡卡尼亚born.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3080/308005/卡卡尼亚born.mp4_20260811_162357.167.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">一份意外的邀约，一份特殊的咨询工作，无关创伤和过往，只是帮助那些罹患选择困难症的贵宾挖掘最真实的食欲。多有趣的工作，我没有理由拒绝！<br />来自首府的一家子人喧喧嚷嚷，几乎调动了所有的侍者为他们搬行李。他们旅途劳顿、饥肠辘辘，又兴奋得什么都想试试。那些愿望太过于混杂，必须予以厘清。男主人，一个劳碌的影子，在议会厅里躲藏与狩猎，现在只想要一顿喷香的飨食；女主人，她的眼睛里是农场和野花，来一份小餐包抚慰这个久居都市的灵魂吧；长女在忧虑什么，来看着镜子，时髦与落伍更迭不休，那么这款永不过时的经典甜品如何；至于幼子，他心灵澄澈，欢笑不停，无论餐盘里端来的是什么。<br />那么，下一位客人的欲求？橙色发辫的女孩由总管领着踏进了餐厅，镜子里没有显现出合适的餐品……哦！我明白了——交给总管吧，她会招待好她的。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"308005\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-308010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/ff/Belonging-308010.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">缎带宽檐帽<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Satin Bonnet</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />2<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一顶宽檐女士礼帽，由佩戴者熟悉的款式改制而成，增添了夸张的缎带，以显示佩戴者特殊的身份。“K”代表什么？许多人都会问出这个问题。一个品牌的代号，一个名字的首字母，还是一个定义自己职业的没有名字的人？她其实并不在意，她总是面带微笑。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-308011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/0a/Belonging-308011.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">秘方手提箱<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Secret Recipe Suitcase</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />95<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>盐、百里香、罗勒、牛至、芹菜、黑胡椒、白胡椒、大蒜、生姜、辣椒……不过是普普通通的香料。人们总是幻想，一定有绝密的配方存在，一定有人生的答案存在，只要寻得就能解决一切。但别忘记，哪怕面对最有魔力的镜子，我们在其中看到的也只有自己的真实欲望。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-308012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/61/Belonging-308012.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">灵知钥匙组<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Keys to Hearts</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>约束之物被称为锁，解锁之物被称为钥，它们总是相对应地出现，却总有人弄丢了自己的钥匙。她所做的，不过是将它们拾起，送还。或许时间久了，她本身也就成了一枚心灵的钥匙。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "含有受损文件链接的页面"}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">镜中上校 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Gourmet Counselor</small></span></span>"}}